hint: For each row i from 1 to n, loop j from `min(i, k)` down to 1.
hint: Going right to left, `row[j - 1]` hasn't been changed yet in this row.
right: Right to left, each update reads two values from the previous row, so one row of k + 1 numbers replaces a triangle of about n × k. Left to right would read a value already changed in this row.
