        run[i] = run[i - 1] + 1
print(run)
print(run[-1], max(run))
```
wrong[[1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3, 4, 1, 2]\n4 4]: The last entry is the run ending at the last number, 2, 3: length 2. The longest run, 4, 7, 8, 9, ends earlier.
